<title>UK: L-Finance sets 1.0 bln French Franc Jan 2007 bond.</title>
<headline>L-Finance sets 1.0 bln French Franc Jan 2007 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BADEN-WUERTEMBERG L-FINANCE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  LANDESKREDITBANK BADEN-WUERTEMBERG, THE STATE</p>
<p>		DEVELOPMENT AGENCY OF BADEN-WUERTTEMBERG</p>
<p> AMOUNT 1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON    *4.125     MATURITY    11.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.675   PAY DATE  L-11.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    100</p>
<p> NOTES     *TILL 11.JAN.99 THEN TEC-10 LESS 117 BP THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		L-LONG FIRST COUPON (FIXED AT 4.475 PCT)</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100 1M SALE LIMS US/UK/FR/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
